     editor viewport already ends above the software keyboard. Reserving the
     keyboard inset again here creates a second keyboard-sized gap and makes
     the focused field jump too far upward. Keep only the edge-to-edge safe
     area clearance in this mode; iOS still needs the generic rule above. */
  :global(html[data-pwa][data-resizes-content]) .tabContent {
