 * screen-owning modal is up. Portaled to `<body>` like the toolbar itself, so it
 * needs its own `position: fixed` and the toolbar's own z-index — the whole
 * point is that it clears the same backdrops the toolbar used to clear.
 * Deliberately small and parked on the edge: at this rank it also floats over
 * small `ModalShell` dialogs, which is why the setting ships off by default.
